OL,3,GNEWSA'An absolute one-off' - former BBC
OL,4,Abroadcaster Conor Bradford dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer BBC News NI radio and TV
OL,7,Fpresenter Conor Bradford has died.
OL,9,FThe veteran broadcaster presented
OL,10,FInside Ulster, Good Morning Ulster and
OL,11,FEvening Extra during a four-decade
OL,12,Fcareer on the airwaves, before retiring
OL,13,Fin 2022.
OL,15,FAdam Smyth, director of BBC Northern
OL,16,FIreland, said Bradford was an "absolute
OL,17,Fone-off".
OL,19,F"His on-air and off-air personas were
OL,20,Fexactly the same; flamboyant, witty,
OL,21,Fwarm and curious - he was a pleasure to
OL,22,Fproduce," he said.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
